<description>&lt;p&gt;Airstrikes by the junta continue to hit towns such as Sittwe, while the Arakan Army is finalising a relocation plan for villages on the Bangladesh-Myanmar border. The US has begun talks with Myanmar’s military authorities, and is reported to be undermining the EU diplomatic blockade on Myanmar. Thai foreign minister announced that the ASEAN envoy will visit Myanmar on Wednesday. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8tWVd6bUotYTVGSzlmTURESXQ2SHhqLXdXMVRob01Da1hQTDVKbmtNUFNDSm1pU0l5cFlDSjFERk9ZMzdtbkpMc0pVdFVoMWVGM0JrcllmSW8xaDY2S0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/artic